  "lastName": "Frolova",
  "overview": "My research is focused on understanding multiple changes in the intracellular environment induced by replication of alphaviruses. We are studying the mechanism of virus-induced innate immune response and alphavirus-specific countermeasures aimed at its downregulation. Understanding of these competing processes is required for development of new vaccine candidates for pathogenic alphaviruses, designing of the alphavirus-based self-amplifying RNAs and antiviral drugs.",
